<title>USA: WPPSS $242 mln refunding bond deal free to trade.</title>
<headline>WPPSS $242 mln refunding bond deal free to trade.</headline>
<text>
<p>WASHINGTON PUBLIC POWER SUPPLY SYSTEM</p>
<p>RE: $241,860,000</p>
<p>NUCLEAR PROJECT N0. 1 &amp; 2 REFUNDING REVENUE BONDS,</p>
<p>SERIES 1996A</p>
<p>BONNEVILLE POWER ADMINISTRATION</p>
<p>Effective immediately all syndicate terms and price</p>
<p>restrictions are removed and the bonds are free to trade on</p>
<p>Project  1.</p>
<p>Goldman, Sachs &amp; Co.</p>
<p>Smith Barney Inc.</p>
<p>Bear, Stearns &amp; Co. Inc.</p>
<p>Grigsby Brandford &amp; Co., Inc.</p>
<p>PaineWebber Incorporated</p>
<p>Seattle-Northwest Securities Corporation</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
